”, “JEWELRY”, and “FABRIC”; all other annotation marks are abstract and unreadable. Modern Korean street-fashion editorial photography, realistic skin and fabric texture, high-detail concept-sheet finish without a specific resolution claim. No brand logo, extra text, watermark, plastic skin, distorted anatomy, extra fingers or excessive infographic clutter."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "用户想法（只改这里 · 写你想要的画面）", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#593930", "size": [430, 270], "pos": [110.19283294677734, 598.2136840820312], "id": 25, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": false, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": false, "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.55.17", "VHS_latentpreview": true, "ds": {"offset": [1061.9286866689251, -109.20094995133252], "scale": 0.6588450000000023}}, "groups": [{"color": "#4a7ebb", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "① 参考图片（可选 Picture）", "bounding": [-523.615478515625, 533.61376953125, 470, 414]}, {"color": "#7a6eb0", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "② 提示词 Prompt（用户想法 → AI增强 → 最终提示词）", "bounding": [-40, 525, 1436.7677001953125, 1422.3232421875]}, {"color": "#b08a4a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "③ 尺寸 / 分辨率", "bounding": [13.683733940124512, 1490.9822998046875, 870, 408]}, {"color": "#5a9e6f", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "④ 模型与加速（自动 · 不用动）", "bounding": [1411.99462890625, 542.6060180664062, 430, 878]}, {"color": "#c0707a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "⑤ 采样 KSampler（自动）", "bounding": [1883.2763671875, 542.6065063476562, 378.3479309082031, 838.2081298828125]}, {"color": "#8a8f99", "font_size